<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:14.090
<i>TURN</i>

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:14.590
<i>TURN-A</i>

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:15.590
<i>TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:16.090
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:16.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:17.510
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN,</i>

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.180
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN</i>

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.680
<i>TURN-A TURN, TURN-A TURN, TURN-A</i>

00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:27.060
<b>King of Legend</b>

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:48.250
The space suits seem to work just fine.

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:50.460
Still, it feels a bit cold in here.

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:51.540
Let's return to the surface.

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:07.140
Use the next wave.

00:02:08.480 --> 00:02:09.650
Like that?

00:02:09.650 --> 00:02:10.980
That's right.

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:13.940
Let your back face outward, and sit on the frame.

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:18.860
There you are, Milady.

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:20.160
Of course I'm here.

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:22.870
It's heavier out here than in the water.

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:24.450
That's just how it is.

00:02:25.370 --> 00:02:28.460
Well, they're still space suits, but yours looks a lot lighter, Loran.

00:02:28.460 --> 00:02:31.670
I'm wearing the one that was sitting inside the White Doll's chest.

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:33.960
It's completely different from the one used by Dianna Counter.

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:36.460
I'll have to ask Mr. Horace to make me a customized suit.

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:37.840
Do you think he can?

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:40.840
It's just a space suit, so it should be possible.

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:55.360
I asked you not to play on that!

00:02:55.360 --> 00:02:56.780
They're fine.

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:05.870
Milady, this should keep the snakes away.

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:07.080
Thank you!

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:20.260
Lady Sochie has become a more reliable Mobile Suit pilot with each passing day.

00:03:21.340 --> 00:03:23.840
Sounds of an explosion? It doesn't seem to be lightning...

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:31.640
That's the Manuipich mountain, Impabura, isn't it?

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:33.270
That's right.

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:37.440
VR Head...

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:40.280
Maximum magnification.

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:48.450
They'll target us if you stand up!

00:03:48.450 --> 00:03:50.250
We'll crawl to avoid them.

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:51.250
Come on!

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:54.250
Why are cannon emplacements all the way out here?

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:03.470
Miashei, Your Kapool is far too visible!

00:04:07.550 --> 00:04:08.970
Ames, let's retreat.

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:10.850
Nonsense!

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:13.640
...Is what I wish I could say, but the way things are now,

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:16.560
We've no choice but to revise our battle plan.

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:26.070
Is this it?

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:30.740
It hurts!

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:36.750
If we don't get our injured treated soon, they'll interfere with our mission.

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:40.550
An injury like this won't kill you...

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.840
Loran, you're a little late.

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:44.260
Miashei?

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:46.340
Looks like a battle just ended here.

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:50.350
Manuipich has already been occupied by the Dianna Counter for some time.

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:51.850
So it seems, huh?

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:55.770
The Mechanical Doll division has suffered heavy losses.

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:58.770
Without better air defenses, we won't be able to fight against them.

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:01.440
They've heavily fortified Manuipich.

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:04.950
Wouldn't we be able to sneak someone in quietly to clear out our opponents?

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:08.450
I never suspected they'd install cannon emplacements like that on the surface.

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:12.370
The cannons were designed to be used on warships or inside a WaDom.

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:17.750
We have to withdraw from Impabura, and allow our forces to regroup.

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:19.750
Colonel, our enemy is...

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:21.960
The enemy is targeting the Willgem.

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:25.670
Tomorrow, their battleships will reach this area and they'll attack us from both ends.

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:30.600
At that point, all of the people from the Inglessa and Luzianna Militia,

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:33.850
and the Willgem itself will meet a quick end!

00:05:33.850 --> 00:05:37.270
Please reconsider and allow us to withdraw.

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:44.070
That cannot be done.

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:45.280
Sir!?

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:47.650
We must take Manuipich by tonight.

00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:50.740
What makes that village at the mountain's top so important!?

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:54.080
It contains a construct that will give the Willgem the means to reach the moon.

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:57.250
That's correct. It also has a structure which lets us perform maintenance on the ship.

00:05:57.250 --> 00:05:59.670
Colonel, Lieutenant Yanni...

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:02.460
Please destroy the cannon emplacements by dawn tomorrow.

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:04.250
That's an order!

00:06:04.250 --> 00:06:06.550
Ades branch? Some kind of tree branch?

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:09.800
Yeah, legends speaks of a mysterious tree branch-

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:13.740
-that's seated atop Manuipich's Impabura, known to them as the Ades Branch.

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:19.770
The Adeskan people are known to be the defenders of this so called Branch of Ades.

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:22.440
Wow, Joseph! You know a lot about this place!

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:25.150
I was born in a village just south of here.

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:27.440
I see! So you're from this region?

00:06:27.440 --> 00:06:28.780
That's right.

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:32.740
We found Joseph at the base of the mountain near here.

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:36.250
Why a branch?

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:40.250
It's just some old legends. I don't know the details either.

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:44.960
I'd really love to hear the legend from the Adeskan people themselves.

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:47.260
Why's that, Uncle Sid?

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:51.970
Old legends like that one very likely have direct connections to the Dark History's ancient technology.

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:54.760
A legend about technology?

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:03.770
So now Dianna Counter has occupied this mountain where the Adeskan people protect this Ades branch.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:14.660
Is that another great mechanical giant?

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:19.250
That's right, a white giant.

00:07:29.470 --> 00:07:32.840
No matter how I view it, that's definitely the White Devil.

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:36.560
It looks exactly like my grandmother described, Lady Mayalito.

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:40.980
The White Devil has come to steal the Ades Branch!

00:07:41.350 --> 00:07:42.640
Do you believe so?

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:43.850
Yurou!

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:50.440
Yurou, you jerk...

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:00.160
Those clothes...

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:01.750
...could she be an Adeskan?

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:17.050
I am not your enemy!

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:20.970
I would like to speak with those who fled from the occupied village!

00:08:20.970 --> 00:08:21.980
Please come out!

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:38.450
We learned about this area's layout before we arrived. The only thing that can help us take down those turrets is the White Doll.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:41.370
I understand what you're saying... but...

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:44.460
White Doll still holds the nuclear weapons in its chest...

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:46.380
If it were hit by the cannon...

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:50.960
Is there a problem? Will the Moonrace's Laura not help us?

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:52.840
The White Doll is unable to battle for now.

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:53.970
Why is that?

00:08:53.970 --> 00:08:55.340
It's not in very good condition at the moment.

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:56.760
Who gives a damn?

00:08:57.050 --> 00:09:00.140
You won't find a single mechanical doll here that IS in good condition!

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:02.140
So long as White Doll can battle...

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:03.140
It doesn't matter.

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:04.350
What do you mean?

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:06.560
There are six cannon emplacements.

00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:09.270
So what? You won't know if it works until you try.

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:10.440
If Gavane could have done it...

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:11.940
Gavane was killed!

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:13.780
You bastard!

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:17.950
Use your head for a change!

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:20.580
You're now the Commander of the Suicide Squadron.

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:22.450
You can't let your soldiers die meaninglessly.

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:27.170
Where are you going?

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:28.540
To inspect the White Doll.

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:29.750
Mr. Joseph!?

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:32.750
I'm sorry, but you haven't earned my full trust yet.

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:34.340
Please, wait!

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:36.970
There's something that you're holding back.

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:38.550
I am...

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:40.350
What is it that you're hiding?

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:41.850
What's going on, Loran?

00:09:41.850 --> 00:09:43.350
Is that true?

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:44.770
No...

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:49.980
Milady Sochie!

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:51.060
Milady?

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:53.070
Milady Sochie?

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:55.940
What happened?

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:57.570
I was hit.

00:09:57.570 --> 00:09:59.870
It was some woman from Adeska.

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:02.450
Did you make contact with any Adeskans?

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:05.870
Yes. Those people apparently don't like outsiders.

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:07.870
Did you shoot this person?

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:10.040
Are you kidding? I was trying to scare them away!

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:12.170
Is that why you got hit?

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:13.960
So that's the way things are?

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:17.840
Even our own scouts won't be able to get inside Manuipich's city?

00:10:17.840 --> 00:10:21.180
That woman shouldn't have been able to just disappear.

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:22.850
What's wrong?

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:24.770
Where did you get that?

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:26.060
From over there...

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:50.170
Who are you?

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:54.670
I am the King of Adeska, Quoatl.

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:57.670
If you're the King, what are you doing here?

00:10:57.670 --> 00:10:59.470
I am awaiting my death.

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:01.550
Waiting for your death?

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:06.770
It began when the people of Adeska all had the same dream.

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:10.270
A dream of a fiery crimson sky in the middle of the night.

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:13.770
We were powerless to do anything against it.

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:22.240
This King of Adeska knows about the power of the Nuclear weapons!

00:11:23.070 --> 00:11:26.660
No, that's simply not true, King of Adeska.

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:31.960
If you help us find the way into your city, We can help Adeska's...

00:11:31.960 --> 00:11:32.960
Don't touch him!

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:33.960
What?

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:35.960
It's her!

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:38.670
Could she be...

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:42.470
Your Majesty, that gray haired person is none other than the White Devil's messenger...

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:45.850
...and he has come here to remove the Branch of Ades!

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:46.850
What!?

00:11:55.270 --> 00:11:56.270
Loran!

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:57.150
Lord!

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:13.540
Mayalito, do not interfere!

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:18.670
Your Majesty!

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:27.180
Within the White Devil's chest, there is a terrible weapon which has the ability to turn the night into day!

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:29.850
You mean that which can burn down even the World Tree?

00:12:29.850 --> 00:12:31.480
That's correct!

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:42.940
I'm in need of your assistance!

00:12:42.940 --> 00:12:44.570
My assistance?

00:12:44.570 --> 00:12:47.240
I intend to head far up into the sky so that I may dispose of this weapon there...

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:50.450
For the sake of doing that, I must reach Manuipich!

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:54.080
Why should I believe what you're saying?

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:56.670
I would never deceive a King!

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:59.960
Who are you to make such statements?

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:04.760
I pledge myself, along with the White Devil I control, to protect the Ades World Tree!

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:17.770
You say that you will control this White Devil to protect the World Tree?

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:25.950
Mayalito, show these people the way to reach the city!

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:29.570
Are you saying that I should show them the King's secret waterway!?

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:32.740
If this situation continues, we're going to lose Manuipich.

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:34.810
With the assistance of these people and the White Devil,

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:38.380
we will most certainly drive out those invaders from the moon!

00:13:38.380 --> 00:13:39.750
I'll make preparations at once.

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:41.210
- Ames!
- Right!

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:48.760
We miners also know how to make good explosives.

00:13:48.760 --> 00:13:52.350
- These'll blow those cannons to bits.
- We'll be counting on you, Uncle Sid.

00:13:53.270 --> 00:13:55.140
That woman who appeared in the cave...

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:00.980
Was she of a different tribe?

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:05.360
Well, young Inglessa man, are you having doubts or will you join us?

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:07.650
I'll be involved in this as well.

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:10.370
Do not judge a person by their appearance.

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:13.240
That's the way it should be, Captain.

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:15.450
Loran, this isn't the time to be getting intimate.

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:17.250
That's not what we're doing.

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:18.870
Will you be able to move while wearing that?

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:20.380
It's fine.

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:24.380
Milady, please don't let anyone get near the White Doll.

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:27.260
I understand. No one will lay a finger on it.

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:28.340
It's up to you.

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:33.350
If your infiltration attempts still fails, gentlemen...

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:40.270
Just after dawn tomorrow morning, 
the Willgem will use its Mega Particle Cannons against the turrets in order to capture Manuipich.

00:14:40.270 --> 00:14:43.770
But isn't Manuipich still the home of the Adeskan people?

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:45.090
I understand that

00:14:45.090 --> 00:14:50.570
But the Moonrace's technicians claim there's no goal more important to us than reaching Impabura's top.

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:53.870
So long as we succeed, everything'll be fine, right?

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:55.240
That's exactly right.

00:14:56.240 --> 00:14:58.250
That flute is Mayalito's signal.

00:14:58.250 --> 00:14:59.370
Let's go, then.

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:00.460
Heading out!

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:01.750
We're counting on you.

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:03.960
Chief Ladderum, please come to the tent.

00:15:03.960 --> 00:15:05.170
Right.

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:12.050
I've been able to collect about 20 fighter planes.

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:13.350
Fighter planes?

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:14.550
Not now.

00:15:14.550 --> 00:15:17.060
I can't blame Miashei for her reaction, but...

00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:20.560
They'll be able to function as bait to divert the shots away from the Willgem.

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:24.560
That's true... The Willgem will already be a huge target once it heads out there.

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:30.070
If Uncle Sid's plan is successful, there'll be no need for us to resort to that.

00:15:30.070 --> 00:15:34.870
I asked your father to collect all of the planes that he could find.

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:37.950
Miashei, I'd also appreciate it if you'd help us service them.

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:39.660
That's how it is.

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:41.080
Papa?

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:48.670
But, if Willgem's Mega Particle Cannons fire on Manuipich, Loran and the Adeskans will be...

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:50.470
Correct. They will all be killed.

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:55.550
That Mega Particle Cannon isn't like conventional gunpowder. It's incredibly devastating...

00:15:55.550 --> 00:15:56.970
I understand.

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:58.560
Please take me to see Sir Guin.

00:15:58.560 --> 00:15:59.770
I can't do that.

00:15:59.770 --> 00:16:00.850
Why not?

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:06.560
He's not aboard the Willgem right now. Furthermore, our orders say you're not allowed to leave here until after the battle's ended.

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:08.070
But that's...

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:13.660
As long as Uncle Sid can destroy the Cannon Emplacements before sunrise, The Willgem won't need to open fire.

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:18.080
Sir Guin's starting to enjoy playing with his new found weapons a bit too much...

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:28.550
Loran...

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:37.850
It's amazing that there would be so much water in a mountain.

00:16:37.850 --> 00:16:40.140
It could be flowing here from an even higher mountain, perhaps.

00:16:40.140 --> 00:16:42.060
It looks like that's it over there.

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:43.060
Let's go, then.

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:49.770
There's a boat in here?

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:53.070
Yes. This is how we will get to Manuipich.

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:54.150
We'll go up in this?

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:56.280
Let's go. You're in a hurry, aren't you?

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:57.570
Yeah, sorry.

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:04.250
It looks like some sort of natural canal.

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:09.170
Correct. Long ago, the tree of Ades' roots ran through here.

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:10.750
The tree's roots?

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:13.670
It shouldn't be surprising that the World Tree's roots would be so large.

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:14.970
I suppose that's true.

00:17:19.550 --> 00:17:21.060
A dead end?

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:22.770
That's because we're in a water elevator.

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:23.980
Here it comes.

00:17:28.350 --> 00:17:29.560
I warned you about that!

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:33.360
The boat is going up, isn't it?

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:34.940
Yes, it seems to be.

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:37.570
The water beneath us...

00:17:37.570 --> 00:17:39.570
Is that some sort of geyser down there?

00:17:39.570 --> 00:17:42.370
We can reach Manuipich once we're at the correct water level.

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:47.870
The world formed thanks to the tree which connected the worlds of the land and the sky.

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:50.040
Because of the Ades Tree.

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:56.260
We, the people of Adeska, lived together with the goddess of the ground at the Ades Tree's base.

00:17:56.260 --> 00:18:01.470
However, on that dreadful day in which the sky burned red, the world changed.

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:08.650
With the Ades tree at the center, the giants from the sky reached the world on the ground, and the giants on the ground reached the world in the sky...

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:10.270
...and there, they fought one another.

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:13.360
Because of this, the ground was soon covered with disease.

00:18:13.360 --> 00:18:15.860
The Moon in the sky began to weep.

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:19.570
Our ancestors wanted to save the Goddess of the ground...

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:23.370
...and so they used the power of the giants to cut down the Tree of Ades.

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:28.460
Then at that point, there was a lone branch which bounced and leapt up into the sky.

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:37.050
The Goddess of the ground was revived.

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:42.850
We, the Adeskans continued to keep guard over the Ades Branch to insure that it won't summon another disaster. However...

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:46.850
...The legend states that the White Devil will one day eventually return to take away the Ades Branch.

00:18:50.850 --> 00:18:52.270
Have we arrived?

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:54.150
It's through that route.

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:56.570
My Lord!

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:59.650
Someone's now using the water elevator!

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:02.160
Mayalito, take our boat to the rapids!

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:03.660
Right!

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:06.160
We're heading down there?

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:09.080
Here we go...

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:16.380
What?

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:17.380
This looks dangerous.

00:19:17.380 --> 00:19:20.340
I don't think they want to welcome their King.

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:24.760
Get down!

00:19:27.970 --> 00:19:29.560
Why are the Adeskan soldiers...

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:31.770
What's going on!?

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:33.060
Could they be Taruka's men!?

00:19:38.780 --> 00:19:39.940
They hit the fires!

00:19:39.940 --> 00:19:42.660
Get this boat moving, woman!

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:50.580
Head into the city from the western stairs!

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:51.750
Let's get moving!

00:20:04.260 --> 00:20:05.260
Damn...

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:08.770
Has our power struggle reached this point, Taruka!?

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:15.650
Did you forget how to speak with your mouth? Did you toss it aside?

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:18.440
Drop your weapons if you want the old man to survive!

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:21.950
- What? 
- Sid!
- Uncle Sid!

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:24.450
Who do you think you are!?

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:27.870
Taruka, I brought these people here...

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:30.870
...for the sake of destroying those evil cannons.

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:32.750
A King who fled has no right to speak here.

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:36.750
Taruka, that man is the messenger of the White Devil!

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:40.260
Yurou, how could you ally yourself with Taruka!?

00:20:40.260 --> 00:20:43.760
I only wanted to tell him about the White Devil's return...

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:46.680
A coward who runs away has no business speaking here.

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:53.750
Quoatl, we who guard the Ades Branch cannot allow the White Devil to enter this city!

00:20:55.350 --> 00:20:59.150
Even after we all shared the same dream where night became day?

00:21:00.860 --> 00:21:02.150
Take him away!

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:15.540
Joseph!

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:28.260
Mayalito!

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:31.060
Don't let them escape!

00:21:31.970 --> 00:21:34.140
Don't! Joseph...

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:43.570
Loran, Hang in there! Hey, Loran!

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:47.570
Hey, wait a sec..!

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:52.370
The White Devil has come for the sake of the Ades Branch.

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:59.460
Taruka, our legend ends at this point.

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:01.880
Even after the sky burns red...

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:04.550
It doesn't mean that our entire world needs to be destroyed.

00:22:04.550 --> 00:22:08.050
At this rate, our city will be destroyed by the giants from the sky.

00:22:08.050 --> 00:22:12.060
This is what the young man who controls the White Devil has told me.

00:22:13.770 --> 00:22:15.850
That bastard...

00:22:16.270 --> 00:22:19.150
We won't be able to make it out of here by morning.

00:22:19.850 --> 00:22:22.650
If things stay this way, we're all going to die.

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b><i>Binetsu ga samenai mama</i></b>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:34.540
<b>As if unawoken from a slight fever</b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b><i>Utsumuku shounen no hitomi wa</i></b>

00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:40.790
<b>The eyes of the boy hanging his head</b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b><i>Kokoro no umi mitsumete</i></b>

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:46.510
<b>Gaze upon the sea of his heart</b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b><i>Shizuka ni hohoenderu</i></b>

00:22:46.510 --> 00:22:50.510
<b>And smile silently</b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b><i>Umare kuru mono kiete yuku mono</i></b>

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:57.020
<b>What is born, and what fades away</b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b><i>Subete wa sadame no furiko no haba</i></b>

00:22:57.020 --> 00:23:03.230
<b>Are but the sway of the pendulum of fate</b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b><i>Zasetsu no yami o tsukinuke mietekuru</i></b>

00:23:03.230 --> 00:23:08.950
<b>Piercing the darkness of frustration, he begins to see it</b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b><i>Sore ga hikari no shinjitsu</i></b>

00:23:08.950 --> 00:23:14.530
<b>It is the reality of the light</b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:14.530 --> 00:23:16.870
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b><i>Yoake totomoni wasuresareru hoshi ni sasagu</i></b>

00:23:16.870 --> 00:23:25.340
<b>Together with dawn, he gives an offering to the stars that will be forgotten</b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b><i>Aura</i></b>

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.630
<b>Aura</b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b><i>Shijou no ai wa chiisana sono te no naka ni aru</i></b>

00:23:27.630 --> 00:23:35.510
<b>History's love lies in his tiny hands</b>

00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:44.810
<i>The people who live by their ancient legends, now begin to fight by way of their ancient customs.</i>

00:23:45.980 --> 00:23:49.070
<i>Quoatl ran away from this fight...</i>

00:23:49.070 --> 00:23:51.070
<i>...because he's willing to help us to destroy the cannons.</i>

00:23:52.070 --> 00:23:56.490
<i>Even if the outcome must be a tragic one, the old legend will still be passed on.</i>

00:23:58.540 --> 00:24:02.920
<i>Next time... on </i>TURN A GUNDAM...
Captured Manuipich

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:05.080
"The wind of kings bellows."

00:24:03.670 --> 00:24:08.420
<b>Captured Manuipich</b>
